        }
      ],
      "title": "隐秘真相 · Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43213001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "你说，那个洛瑞丝说的计划究竟是什么啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "谁知道呢，解开那个稀金卡牌的谜团，一切就真相大白了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "有道理，我这就想办法把那几张卡牌弄到手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "他们看得很紧，你最好小心点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "轰隆——嘭——BOOM——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "糟了，S-VIII，这是陷阱！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "啧，我还纳闷一路怎么这么顺利……\n跟我来，我们从那边的通道撤走！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "不行！所有的通道都被突然出现的栅栏封住了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "熟悉的脚步声传来——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "你们竟能找到这里，真让人意外，可惜已经太迟了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "数据集里的东西我已势在必得，我不会让任何人阻碍我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "哼，和我做生意还想反咬我一口，你这是在玩火。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "放眼整个黑市，敢当面挑衅我的人，通常都不会有好下场。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "当然，我从不怀疑你们的实力。所以，我只能选择困住你们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "等数据集的拷贝如期完成，你们两个也就不足为惧了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43213016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "什么？！喂，别走，放我们出去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1144",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "ladon",
          "rowIds": [
            43213001,
            43213002,
            43213003,
